---
import LegalLayout from '../components/LegalLayout.astro';
---
<LegalLayout
  title="Accessibility"
  description="GICT's accessibility commitment, the measures used on this website and how to report a barrier or request content in another format."
  active="/accessibility"
>
  <p><strong>Last reviewed:</strong> 21 October 2026</p>

  <h2>Our commitment</h2>
  <p>
    We want this website to be usable by as many people as possible, including keyboard users, screen-reader
    users, people with low vision and people using small or older devices. The site is designed with the
    Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 Level AA as the target.
  </p>

  <h2>What we have implemented</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Semantic page structure with a skip-to-content link.</li>
    <li>Visible keyboard focus and keyboard-operable navigation, filters and forms.</li>
    <li>Labels, hints and error messages for form fields.</li>
    <li>Colour contrast checked for text and interactive elements.</li>
    <li>Reduced-motion support for users who prefer less animation.</li>
    <li>Responsive layouts tested at mobile, tablet and desktop widths.</li>
    <li>Calculator results announced to assistive technology without disrupting typing.</li>
    <li>Text alternatives for meaningful images and decorative images hidden from assistive technology.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Known limitations</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Third-party services such as WhatsApp and Google Maps have their own accessibility behaviour, which we do not control.</li>
    <li>Some PDFs or documents, if added later, may not be fully tagged. We will provide an alternative on request.</li>
    <li>Older faculty photographs may have limited resolution, but names and roles are always provided in text.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Feedback</h2>
  <p>
    If you encounter a barrier, please tell us the page, what you were trying to do and the browser or
    assistive technology you use. Email <a href="mailto:info@gict.edu.pk">info@gict.edu.pk</a> or call
    <a href="tel:+923390006853">0339 0006853</a>. We will try to provide the information in another format and
    fix the issue where possible.
  </p>

  <h2>Review</h2>
  <p>
    We review accessibility when major pages or components change, and at least annually. This statement will
    be updated with the review date.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
